Z||000000||grinthock||07-30-2001||11:59 PM||||Hey everyone, I have a 87GT with the slider controls for the A/C, can I put in a Double din?  Is it possible?  has it been done?  How much work is it?   <P>Anyone got pics?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://grinthock.2y.net/pics/87gt/S_P000386.JPG">   <P>Home page: <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroworld.com</A> Home  of the fiero voting booth!<BR>Owner of 85 GT<BR>87 GT Silver<BR>1995 Ford Escort Wagoon POS||||reg||1
Z||000001||DecadenceR||07-31-2001||01:08 AM||||I'm sure it's possible. you're just going to have to do some cutting of the trim, a custom design to hold it in there and make it look good. but I'm almost positive there's enough room in there.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Philphine||07-31-2001||10:57 AM||||a couple of times someones shown a double din unit here, but i forgot his name. looked pretty good. i'd try it myself but i need room for a 1/2 din eq too.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Carrolles||07-31-2001||01:13 PM||||I'm working on one right now.  I got an AM/FM/Tape/CD unit out of a 1998 Olds 98 that is a double din.  The black plastic support frame that runs under the shifter up to the radio and A/C controls has to be modified.  I picked up a spare at Ed Park's swap meet for $5.00 US and have been whittling on it in my spare time.<P>Looking at the plastic frame that the radio mounts in you will see that there is a flat place that the radio rests on.  This has to be removed to allow for the double din chassis to slip in.  I also had to trim the horizontal plastic piece that runs beween the radio and the A/C controls.  I used a cut off wheel on my Dremel Tool to do the cutting.<P>I'm able to cram the double din chassis in the hole but it sits too low for the radio faceplate to clear the vinyl radio console surround.  I'm working on either trimming the radio face plate or modifying the console surround.  When I get this worked out I'll trim the Fiero faceplate to fit.<P>It's not a high priority project but I'll post pictures if I make it work.<P>Good luck,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
